                <pb facs="0201" n="121" sameAs="frus:frus1902/pg121"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Hay to Mr.
                            Hutchinson.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1902-11-13"><hi rendition="#italic">November 13,
                        1902</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. Hay directs Mr. Hutchinson to accept return, by Chilean Government, of the
                    money paid for cleaning the U. S. S. <hi rendition="#italic">Iowa</hi>, and to
                    express thanks for the generous courtesy.)</p>
            </div>
        </body>
